    highlights: 'The Varanasi to Ayodhya tempo traveller pilgrimage connects two of Hinduism\'s holiest cities. After experiencing the Ganga Aarti and Kashi Vishwanath darshan, groups travel to the birthplace of Lord Ram. The route passes through the spiritual heartland of Uttar Pradesh via Jaunpur. The newly built Ram Mandir has made this a must-do combined pilgrimage for groups.',
